sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant IstioGW as Istio Ingress Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Frontend as workspaces-frontend<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (nginx)
    participant Backend as workspaces-backend<br/>4000/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAuthZ as Kubernetes AuthZ API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as workspaces-controller<br/>(watch)
    participant WsPod as Workspace Pod<br/>(StatefulSet)

    Note over User, WsPod: Flow 1: User Creates a Workspace

    User->>IstioGW: GET /workspaces/<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    IstioGW->>Frontend: HTTP/8080<br/>mTLS (Istio sidecar)<br/>AuthorizationPolicy
    Frontend-->>User: SPA HTML/JS/CSS

    User->>IstioGW: POST /workspaces/api/v1/workspaces/{ns}<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>kubeflow-userid header
    IstioGW->>Backend: HTTP/4000<br/>mTLS (Istio sidecar)<br/>AuthorizationPolicy

    Backend->>K8sAuthZ: SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAuthZ-->>Backend: Allowed

    Backend->>K8sAPI: Create Workspace CR<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Workspace Created
    Backend-->>IstioGW: 201 Created (JSON)
    IstioGW-->>User: Response

    Note over K8sAPI, Controller: Controller reconciliation (watch event)

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: Workspace created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create StatefulSet<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Service (ws-{name}-{hash})<br/>HTTPS/6443
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create VirtualService (Istio)<br/>HTTPS/6443

    Note over User, WsPod: Flow 2: Workspace Pod Connectivity (Istio)

    User->>IstioGW: GET /workspace/connect/{ns}/{name}/{portId}/<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Session cookie
    IstioGW->>WsPod: HTTP/dynamic<br/>mTLS (Istio sidecar)<br/>VirtualService routing
    WsPod-->>IstioGW: IDE content (JupyterLab/RStudio/VS Code)
    IstioGW-->>User: IDE response
